# One violin chord, the ensemble swept dry -> lush -> seasick and back, then a held lush chord: listen for the
# three-phase shimmer growing, the common wow from 153 on, and no pitch jump when the depth moves.
tempo 90
steps 32
tail 2.5
track chord
param p1 192
param attack 40
param sustain 255
param release 70
sweep p2 0 255 0 16
sweep p2 255 153 16 24
note 0 A3 32 120
note 0 Db4 32 120
note 0 E4 32 120
expect sound 0 32
expect idle 46
expect peak_below -4
